    "Account Help": {},
    "Account authorization tokens are stored in Apple Keychain. App preferences, a selected catalog wallpaper, a random device identifier, catalog cache, favorites, launcher choices, and resumable-session state are stored locally so the app can work reliably across launches.": {},
