    "Switch": {},
    "Switching account": {},
    "Switching accounts updates launches, library sync, cloud storage, and store connections.": {},
    "Take your time completing sign-in. OpenNOW will wait up to five minutes for NVIDIA to return to the app.": {},
    "Tap Clicks Where You Touch": {},
    "Testing": {},
    "Text is sent directly to the active game. Nothing is copied to the system clipboard.": {},
    "Text to type into stream": {},
    "Thanks": {},
    "Thanks to the people helping improve OpenNOW for everyone.": {},
    "Thanks — the maintainers have what they need to look into it.": {},
    "Thanks. Your reference is %@.": {},
    "The Apple performance HUD is the system's own GPU readout drawn over the video. It is off unless you turn it on here — OpenNOW's stats overlay covers what most people need, and the system one sits on top of the game.": {},
    "The native decoder cuts a frame or two of latency. Turn it off if the picture tears or stutters.": {},
    "The session report appears after a stream ends and scores how the connection held up. The chime plays once when a rig frees up, so you can put the phone down while you wait for a long queue.": {},
    "The stream keeps running while controls are open.": {},
    "This clears local settings, saved accounts, launch choices, favorites, session state, and cached images on this device.": {},
    "This is different from that": {},
    "This removes every saved GeForce NOW account from this device.": {},
    "This removes the linked account from GeForce NOW. You can connect it again later.": {},
    "This session was too short to measure properly, so treat the score as a rough reading.": {},
